/-- Given a filtration `𝓕`, the predictable σ-algebra is the σ-algebra on `ι × Ω` generated by
sets of the form `(t, ∞) × A` for `t ∈ ι` and `A ∈ 𝓕 t` and `{⊥} × A` for `A ∈ 𝓕 ⊥`. -/
@[instance_reducible]
